# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# Tahoe live image package list (x86_64). archiso hard-requires mkinitcpio
# and mkinitcpio-archiso in this list.
#
# STATUS: desktop session added 2026-10-18; first green CI build the same
# day (run 39159947256: tahoe-2026.10.18-x86_64.iso, 1.7 GiB, with the
# [tahoe] rows skipped for missing tags). Nothing, including boot, verified
# beyond the build itself — see docs/iso-session.md for the honest list.

# ── base ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
base
linux
linux-firmware
mkinitcpio
mkinitcpio-archiso
syslinux
systemd
systemd-sysvcompat
pacman
archlinux-keyring
sudo

# ── first-party packages ([tahoe] repo, see packages/) ──────────────
tahoe-base
tahoe-compositor
tahoe-uel

# ── the installer ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Calamares, the same installer CachyOS and most Arch derivatives brand.
# NOT in Arch's repositories (verified: 0 results in the packages API, absent
# from the extra listing) — it lives in the AUR, so it has to be built or
# taken from a binary repository before this line can resolve. build.sh drops
# it when it is unavailable and the ISO still builds; see
# docs/iso-installer.md for the decision this is waiting on.
calamares

# ── execution layers + portals ──────────────────────────────────────
flatpak
xdg-desktop-portal
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
xdg-utils
polkit

# ── the desktop: Hyprland + MacShell ────────────────────────────────
hyprland
hyprlock
hyprpaper
quickshell
qt6-shadertools
qt6-svg

# ── sound ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
pipewire
wireplumber
pipewire-pulse

# ── network / bluetooth ─────────────────────────────────────────────
networkmanager
bluez
bluez-utils

# ── shell helpers mentioned by MacShell's README ────────────────────
kitty
thunar
papirus-icon-theme
inter-font
noto-fonts
noto-fonts-emoji
grim
slurp
wl-clipboard
cliphist
wf-recorder
libnotify
brightnessctl
inotify-tools
xorg-xwayland
zenity
fastfetch
